feel of the Highcharts streamgraph in plain D3.

Unlike \code{\link{stacked_area_chart}()}, which takes wide data and stacks
areas on a zero baseline, \code{streamgraph()} takes long (tidy) data, uses
a centred baseline (\code{offset}), orders layers inside out so the largest
